  "body": "## 3.2.3\r\n\r\n**Added**\r\n- Search types on the PS3 system keyboard instead of the drawn one.\r\n\r\n**Fixed**\r\n- Stuck on \"Finding versions...\" for a film opened from Search.\r\n- Films playing in the wrong language: playback now starts on a soundtrack in your PS3's system language when there is one.\r\n- Home's posters glide at 3.1's speed again; the wave no longer stutters behind the version picker or music player.\r\n- Titles with no streams say so instead of offering a Play that ends in an HTTP 500.\r\n- Playback that dies before its first picture explains why instead of a black screen.\r\n- Sharper posters; the player bar hides when paused.\r\n\r\nFull notes in CHANGELOG.md. Install JellyFin-PS3.pkg over the existing copy; settings are kept."
